# CVE-2024-49203: QueryDSL HQL injection via orderBy
# No fixed version released for querydsl-jpa 5.1.0 (latest).
# Not exploitable in this codebase: all orderBy calls use type-safe QueryDSL path
# expressions (ComparableExpressionBase / PathBuilder), never raw user-supplied HQL strings.
# Reviewed in ProjectService.java and MapViewService.java.
